name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-lesson7-cfu_2026'
title 'Check for Understanding'

question 'Perceivable'
answer 'When the volume slider moves, a screen-reader user hears the new volume announced.'

question 'Operable'
answer 'Every interactive element can be reached and triggered with the keyboard alone.'

question 'Understandable'
answer 'The button label "Send my message" tells the user exactly what will happen.'

question 'Robust'
answer 'The app still works when the user has reduced motion turned on or is on an older phone.'

allow_multiple_attempts true
height '100'
